# International: Germany, then its Date Format dialog ("dd.MM.yyyy" gives the century check box the
# state 2, which a check box shows checked; DMY radio buttons hold the tab stop), Cancel, Cancel.
# Same keys as arch311-ref/scn/intl-dategerm.scn after opening. Run as intl.w16
# (ARCH311_PRISTINE_INI=1, ARCH311_CLOCK="2026-10-08 09:30:24", applet International); the
# country change lands in :28 as on the reference.
sleep 900
shot shots/01-open.png
sleep 3600
type g
sleep 500
shot shots/02-germany.png
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key enter
sleep 600
shot shots/03-date.png
key esc
sleep 400
shot shots/04-cancel.png
key esc
sleep 400
quit
